tic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras/99dde0fcb05f3f6e556a5928465e0280.avif?t=1753281262\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you sell more slimes you will level up and make more money which will allow you to expand the store, hire staff, and buy even more slimes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras/5cbfc142bb1c4c60a66f783f947dadee.avif?t=1753281262\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
